till needs airflow or moisture to feel effective, so it is not a replacement for shade, water or sensible timing."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Measure before choosing a size.",{"children":[["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5","key":"1gmf2c"}]],"className":"lucide-check","size":18}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Measure before choosing a size."}]]}],["$","li","Prefer breathable, quick-drying material.",{"children":[["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:props:children:4:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-check","size":18}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Prefer breathable, quick-drying material."}]]}],["$","li","Check whether it can be machine washed.",{"children":[["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:props:children:4:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-check","size":18}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Check whether it can be machine washed."}]]}],["$","li","Read recent reviews about fit in hot weather.",{"children":[["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:props:children:4:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-check","size":18}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Read recent reviews about fit in hot weather."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","Avoid common mistakes",{"className":"article-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Avoid common mistakes"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Do not assume one size fits every arm. Stop using anything that causes numbness, irritation or uncomfortable pressure. For long sun exposure, combine clothing with shade and appropriate sunscreen."}],"$undefined"]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-actions","children":[["$","$Ld",null,{"href":"/","children":["Browse product finds ",["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M5 12h14","k